    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10580" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντίτᾰσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντιτείνω</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>stretching the contrary
				way,</i> e.g. in the setting of a dislocated limb, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				75
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>opposition, resistance,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾶσαν ἀ. ἀντιτείνειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					781c
				</span></i>
			.</div>
